    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01JH157G3BVF48MHHZWP6JQMXP\">You will learn </h2>\n<p>Learn about Klaviyo’s calendar view for your campaigns, including filtering options and how to schedule email, SMS, and push notification campaigns from within the calendar. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JH157G3B4HAFNTYM437E01MV\">Access your campaign calendar </h2>\n<p>To access your campaign calendar:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to the <strong>Campaigns</strong> tab.</li>\n<li>Click the calendar icon in the top right.<br>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32572015448859\" alt=\"Calendar icon in the Campaigns tab\" width=\"227\" height=\"130\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01JH157G3BSBHZEKSJH2ZM3JMA\">Adjust the calendar view</h3>\n<p>You can view your campaign calendar by day, week, or month. To adjust your view: </p>\n<ol>\n<li>Click the <strong>Month</strong> dropdown in the filters bar above the calendar. Note that the dropdown may be labeled <strong>Day</strong> or <strong>Month</strong> if you’ve previously adjusted the view.<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32572005733531\" alt=\"Dropdown showing the calendar view options\" width=\"326\" height=\"202\">\n</li>\n<li>Select a different view from the dropdown menu. </li>\n<li>Click the action button (3 dots) to the far right to adjust additional campaign settings.<br>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32572015462171\" alt=\"Action button for a campaign\" width=\"243\" height=\"200\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01JH157G3B3PGXNY69KX6YS5PE\">Filter and sort your campaigns</h3>\n<p>Use the various dropdowns in the filters bar to display only specific campaigns based on the type or details of the campaign.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32572015467035\" alt=\"Filtering and sorting options for the Campaigns tab\" width=\"670\" height=\"44\"></p>\n<p>Learn more about the <a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/14719736311067\">view and filter options available in your campaign calendar</a>. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JH157G3BCQ3MY6GCSQJRXW9X\">Schedule an email, SMS, or push notification</h2>\n<p>There are 2 ways to schedule a campaign from your calendar. </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Click <strong>Create</strong> in the top-right corner of the calendar.<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32572005750043\" alt=\"Button to create a new campaign\" width=\"292\" height=\"57\">\n</li>\n<li>Click on an empty space (either today or a future date) in your calendar to start building a campaign on that date. Note that if you build a draft campaign on a date, but the date passes and the campaign remains in draft mode, the campaign will not be sent.</li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
